# Everything the runtime does not need, and two things it must never contain.
#
# **THE SECRETS.** `.env` holds a webhook secret and a client secret, and `*.pem` is the App's
# private key. A secret copied into a layer is a secret in every registry that pulls the image.
.env
.env.*
*.pem

# Research is a separate uv project on a different interpreter and imports pandas. Rule 11 says it
# must not reach the product; not shipping it is the strongest form of that.
research/
tests/
docs/
.git/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.db
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
.verify-clone/
